l.png/70px-Portrait_Falael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Portrait_Falael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\"><i>One five six, one five seven, one five</i> - oh! Um, sorry, can't chat! <i>One five</i>... shit, where was I up to?</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Falael</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Falael can be found counting stacks of papers outside the main building. If interrupted, she loses track of her current count and the party can helpfully (or unhelpfully) answer:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\"></span></span>You'd got up to one five eight.</span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/26px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/39px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/52px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/26px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/26px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/39px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/52px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/26px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3b8f1f ;\">+1</span></span> <span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 26px; height: 26px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/26px-Gale_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/39px-Gale_Approval.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/52px-Gale_Approval.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale approves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/26px-Gale_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png